  "scope": "Seventh scrolling group: the draggable sheet extent model, its configured sheet, and its mounted state. The &mut self state setters (parent height, inner extents/physics, parent controllers, listeners, actuator) and activity tokens are exercised behaviorally; the ledger tracks constructor inputs and fluent Self-returning options per its discovery rule. Extent validation is centralized at DraggableSheetExtent::new; snap animations are caller-driven handles where dropping supersedes. One controller across unrelated sheets stays a W5 gap. This ledger covers only this family; it does not claim whole-codebase completeness.",
